          %h3#RelationTo4TRelations Relation to 4T-relations
          %p
            Under the embedding of the set of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/round+chord+diagrams"} round chord diagrams
            into the set of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacobi+diagrams"} Jacobi diagrams
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/STU-relations"} STU-relations
            imply the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/4T+relations"} 4T relations
            on
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/round+chord+diagrams"} round chord diagrams
          %center
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/STURelationImplies4TRelation.jpg", :width => "300"}/
          %p
            Using this, one finds that
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chord+diagrams+modulo+4T+are+Jacobi+diagrams+modulo+STU"} chord diagrams modulo 4T are Jacobi diagrams modulo STU
          %center
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/ChordDiagModulo4TAreJAcobiDiagModuloSTU.jpg", :width => "840"}/
          %blockquote
            %p
              graphics from
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Differential+Cohomotopy+implies+intersecting+brane+observables"} Sati-Schreiber 19c
          %h3#relation_to_knotgraph_complex Relation to knot-graph complex
          %p
            That the STU-relations characterize the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cochain+cohomology"} cochain cohomology
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/knot-graph+complex"} knot-graph complex
            in the respective degrees is shown in
            %a{:href => "#KoytcheffMunsonVolic13"} Koytcheff-Munson-Volic 13, Section 3.4
          %center
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/VolicSTURelation.jpg", :width => "520"}/
          %blockquote
            %p
              graphics grabbed from
              %a{:href => "#KoytcheffMunsonVolic13"} Koytcheff-Munson-Volic 13
